2. Third-party software and speech models
-----------------------------------------

Kitsumi Live Server works by running software and speech models made by
others. None of them is part of this repository, and none of them is covered
by section 1. They are downloaded to your computer from their own publishers,
by the setup file or by you, and each is governed by its own licence. Those
licences prevail over anything here.

They are listed, with their publishers and licences, in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. By installing them you accept their licences. This
includes NVIDIA's own licence terms for the NVIDIA libraries, which are
installed only on a computer with an NVIDIA graphics card.


