6. Use of the software
----------------------

Kitsumi Live Server is a tool. It turns sound that your own computer sends it
into text, and it supplies no video, audio or subtitles of its own.

You are responsible for having the right to access the material you use it
with, and for what you do with the text it writes, including sharing it with
others, under the terms of the sites and services you use and the laws that
apply to you, copyright included.


